      "message": "while collected \u003c max_entries only increments collected when a TIME_CHANGE_AUDIT entry is found. However, after journal.Reader.get_previous() reaches the beginning of the journal, it returns {} rather than raising StopIteration. That means a system with no matching audit entry, or fewer entries than requested, can loop forever.\n\nAdd if not entry: break immediately after entry \u003d reader.get_previous().",
